x.q('retry_freshness_and_progress',5,17,27,'generic_retry','Retryable same-edge repair mints new run,call,manifest at minimum. Rebuild prompts/manifests from current workspace/runtime; old manifests remain evidence, never current redispatch. Prompt requires inspect present target,identify already realized and remaining gap,continue construction before assessment. ABG owns default retryability,bounds,stationary stop/escalation. Domain may refine budget,retryability,escalation,progress via declared GTL/policy only, no shadow runtime. Continue only while policy permits and new signal exists; exhausted budget or no new signal authoritatively stops/escalates.')
